---
/*
  #services — teaser only.

  The five service descriptions moved to /services. Same pattern as #about and
  #languages: once a section has a dedicated page, the homepage keeps a short
  signpost rather than duplicating it.

  The id stays `services` because /about links to `/#services`.
*/
---

<section id="services" class="wrap" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="sample-box">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Services</div>
      <h2 id="services-heading">Beyond collection.</h2>
      <p>
        Commissioned data collection, annotation and labelling, data strategy and compliance
        consultancy, corpus licensing, and translation and localisation — for teams who need
        data built, made usable, or cleared for use.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services">
      See all services <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
